othing and the saturated, retro-futuristic pop-art backdrop creates an intense visual dissonance, emphasizing sharp silhouettes, paper cut-out edges, dynamic compositional balance, and clean graphic novel textures. Absolutely no text, no typography, no letters, no words, no numbers, no logos, no watermark, no captions, pure imagery only."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [497.1397399902344, 505.76922607421875], "pos": [400, 0], "id": 474, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [676], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [47851188483115, "randomize", 25, 1, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 692, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 677, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 679, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 678, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "name": "cfg", "label": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "name": "sampler_name", "label": "sampler_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "sampler_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "name": "scheduler", "label": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "scheduler"}, {"widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "name": "d